WEBVTT

00:00:01.800 --> 00:00:05.200
At first light, in the quiet of the desert,

00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:10.500
begins with a single ingredient, chosen by hand.

00:00:14.600 --> 00:00:20.300
Blended slowly, rested for weeks, and sealed with care.

00:00:20.700 --> 00:00:23.500
Oud & Ember.

00:00:26.700 --> 00:00:29.900
Perfume, slow-crafted in the Emirates.
